<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pendaftaran Berhasil | SIMITRADUDIKA</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <style>
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }
    .animate-float { animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
    
    @keyframes scale-in {
      0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }
    .animate-scale-in { animation: scale-in 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

  <div class="bg-white w-full max-w-lg rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 md:p-12 text-center animate-scale-in">
    
    <!-- Icon Animasi -->
    <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-emerald-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-100 animate-float">
      <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-12 h-12 text-emerald-600"></i>
    </div>

    <!-- Judul & Pesan -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">Pendaftaran Berhasil!</h1>
    
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Terima kasih telah mendaftar di <span class="font-semibold text-indigo-600">SIMITRADUDIKA</span>. 
      Data institusi Anda saat ini sedang dalam proses <strong>review keamanan</strong> oleh tim admin kami.
    </p>

    <!-- Info Box -->
    <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-xl p-4 mb-8 text-left">
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <i data-lucide="info" class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
        <div class="text-sm text-indigo-800 space-y-2">
          <p>⏱️ <strong>Estimasi Waktu:</strong> Maksimal 1x24 jam kerja.</p>
          <p>📧 <strong>Notifikasi:</strong> Kami akan mengirimkan email ke alamat yang Anda daftarkan segera setelah akun diaktifkan.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Action Buttons -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-6 py-3.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 transform active:scale-[0.98]">
        <i data-lucide="home" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        Kembali ke Beranda
      </a>
      
      <a href="/login" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all font-semibold">
        <i data-lucide="log-in" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        Ke Halaman Login
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Note -->
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-8">
      Butuh bantuan segera? Hubungi tim support kami di <a href="mailto:support@simitradudika.id" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">support@simitradudika.id</a>
    </p>

  </div>

  <script>
    // Inisialisasi ikon
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>